        "evocation",
        "incapacitation",
        "primal",
        "sonic"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Frequency three times per day; The korred unleashes an otherworldly laugh. Each non-fey creature within a 30-foot burst must attempt a DC 21 Fortitude save. On a failure, the creature is slowed 1 for 1 round (or stunned 1 on a critical failure)."
      ],
